Use io.
Define local values as array<whole number, 7>.
Set item 0 of values to 15.
Set item 1 of values to 16.
Set item 2 of values to 17.
Set item 3 of values to 18.
Set item 4 of values to 19.
Set item 5 of values to 20.
Set item 6 of values to 21.
Let status be 0.
If every x in values is more than 0, add 1 to status.
If some x in values is more than 20, add 2 to status.
If no x in values is less than 0, add 4 to status.
While some x in values is more than 35.
Add 1 to status.
Break.
End the loop.
Say status.
Give back 0.
